      "content": "Wait, sorry—did you just say \"goblin-infested\"? I think there might be a glitch in your response or something. I'm asking about technical maritime disruptions and operational anomalies in a professional logistics context. \n\nAre \"goblins\" an actual industry term or a type of documented maritime risk I haven't heard of? Please clarify what you mean by \"goblin factor\" and \"goblin risk\" in the context of a CIF contract for semiconductor components.",
